            "heading": "Product Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Sizes: Small for dogs under 10 lbs, Medium for under 30 lbs, Large for over 30 lbs</li><li>Recovery-first orthopedic construction built for joint support</li><li>Natural coconut coir core, hemp support layer, wool wrap, organic cotton cover</li><li>Breathable and temperature-regulating, no synthetic foams</li><li>Removable, washable organic cotton cover</li><li>Bed frame not included</li></ul>",
