          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Built on a foundation of coconut coir, hemp, and wool, with zero synthetic materials. The firm coconut coir core gives orthopedic support that reduces joint pressure and resists flattening. A hemp layer adds breathable, naturally antimicrobial airflow to prevent overheating. A thick wool wrap regulates temperature and relaxes muscles. It's finished with a soft organic cotton sateen cover that's removable and washable.</p>",
            "page": "",
